    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Thief's Edge class feature</p><p>The thief chooses one of the skills she selected with thief's edge. Once per day, the thief can reroll a skill check she just made with the selected skill and take the better result. The skill check cannot take more than 1 round. She can use this reroll with the selected skill one additional time per day at 10th level and every 5 levels thereafter. A thief can select this talent multiple times. Each time, the thief must choose a different skill.</p>",
